<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12884" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκοιμάομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		 with fut.
		
			Med.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσομαι</span>:— <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sleep away from home,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύκτα -ηθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					762c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν Λακεδαίμονι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					208
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>get a little sleep,</i> esp. of troops on duty, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.76
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				213
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.4.22
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.79.10
			</span></i>; simply, <i>fall asleep,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				8.23.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>die an easy death,</i> Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				126.28
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
